zU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2024-10-19T12:35:09Z","updated_at":"2024-11-13T15:55:12Z","closed_at":"2024-11-13T15:52:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n- Used [44fa552343722bb048e2d7c6d3661174a95a8a3c](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/44fa552343722bb048e2d7c6d3661174a95a8a3c)\r\n- Latest VS Studio Professional Preview 2022\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nWindows 11 Pro 27723\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nThe .NET 9 left preview and is on release-candidate state, due to this the godot global.json file which by default has \"rollForward\": \"latestMajor\", is jumping from .NET 8 to .NET 9 during the build and glue procedures, but godot itself cannot load .NET 9 binaries, due to changes on them from .NET 8 to .NET 9, we should either start adding .NET 9 binary support for godot (as in RC state it won't change the actual binary structure any further again on this version), or alter the global.json so it does not jump to RCs of new major releases. By default, by having the latest SDKs installed on the system, the godot will automatically try to use the .NET 9 and thus fail to load the resulting binaries afterwards.\r\nIt used to work perfectly while the .NET 9 SDK were marked as preview, after latest update from VS Studio Installer, which marked it as RC instead, this started happening.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nSimply have latest .NET SDK tools installed on your system and build normally.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\nIts build issue, thus theres no MRP.","closed_by":{"login":"HKunogi","id":1687701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc3MDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi","html_url":"https://github.com/HKunogi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HKunogi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98334/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98334/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}